<section class="yi-card yi-card--header-plain" style="max-inline-size: 32rem">
<header class="yi-card__header">
<div class="yi-card__heading">
<h2 class="yi-card__title">EU gateway outage</h2>
<p class="yi-card__subtitle">Resolved, updated 12 minutes ago</p>
</div>
</header>
<div class="yi-card__body">
<div class="yi-markdown">
<h4 class="yi-heading yi-heading--xl">What happened</h4>
<p>Requests to the EU gateway failed for <strong class="yi-text">14 minutes</strong> after a certificate was
renewed with the wrong chain.</p>
<h4 class="yi-heading yi-heading--xl">What we are doing</h4>
<ul>
<li>The certificate has been reissued and <code class="yi-inline-code">eu-gateway</code> is healthy again.</li>
<li>Renewals now verify the full chain before they are installed.</li>
</ul>
<h5 class="yi-heading yi-heading--md">Still to do</h5>
<p>Review the other regions for the same renewal path.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
